## Data Sources

All federal district data included in this project is sourced from official
United States federal government agencies and is in the public domain.

Individual data sources:
- US Courts of Appeals Circuits: US Courts (uscourts.gov)
- US Bankruptcy Courts: US Courts (uscourts.gov)
- FEMA Regions: Federal Emergency Management Agency (fema.gov)
- EPA Regions: Environmental Protection Agency (epa.gov)
- Federal Reserve Districts: Federal Reserve System (federalreserve.gov)
- Census Regions & Divisions: US Census Bureau (census.gov)
- Department of Education Regions: US Department of Education (ed.gov)
- BLM Districts: Bureau of Land Management (blm.gov)
- Coast Guard Districts: US Coast Guard (uscg.mil)

This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by any US federal agency.
